      <Docs>
        <summary>Print an abbreviated version of the unit name.</summary>
        <value>The setting that selects the shortest unit abbreviation or currency symbol available.</value>
        <remarks>
          <para>Print an abbreviated version of the unit name. Similar to SHORT, but always use the shortest available abbreviation or symbol. This option can be used when the context hints at the identity of the unit. For more information on the difference between NARROW and SHORT, see SHORT.</para>
          <para>In CLDR, this option corresponds to the "Narrow" format for measure units and the "¤¤¤¤¤" placeholder for currencies.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/icu/number/NumberFormatter.UnitWidth#NARROW" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.icu.number.NumberFormatter.UnitWidth.NARROW</code>.</a></format></para>
